{"4586050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "CINIS", "steam_appid": 4586050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CINIS</strong> is a fast-paced FPS-RPG set in a dying world. Master a lethal combination of long-range gunplay, close quarters parry-based melee, and powerful Runic Miracles in order to purge the Chaos Rifts and restore order to the Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586050/extras/7997dcdc833f771946d562a1cbae37a5.avif?t=1777059546\" alt=\"The Reign of Chaos\" width=512 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Reigns</strong> under the rule of <strong>CINIS</strong>, the god of Chaos. Madness has flooded the world, and it appears it may be the very end of the Realm. Factions of the gods have turned on each other, plague runs rampant, the dead live yet again, war scorches the earth, and fields stand empty or dying.<br><br>In the midst of this, will you remain faithful to <strong>Orden</strong>, the god of Law and Order, or embrace the Chaos you swore to contain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586050/extras/c85647630587ab1cab0aae5edcad46ca.avif?t=1777059546\" width=512 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CINIS features a unique blend of FPS Shooting, melee combat &amp; RPG mechanics</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrust and Fire:</strong> Dual-Wield a Gun and melee weapon to fire and parry in the same breath, while managing your stamina and bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your Specialty:</strong> Dodge and weave between attacks, tank them with heavy plate-armor, sneak through areas unseen, or mix-up the approach as you like. The choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield your Faith</strong>: Call upon the gods to pacify your enemies' minds, burn them with divine fire, or summon thunderstorms amidst combat through <strong>Divine Runic Miracles.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore The Realm &amp; Cleanse it of Chaos</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected World:</strong> A fully interconnected world with no loading screens, featuring loop-backs and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consumed by Chaos:</strong> Set foot in the chaos corrupted areas, where commoners have become violently mad, and pets have turned into blood-lusting beasts, and <strong>reality itself begins to warp</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Rifts:</strong> Rest at Cleansed Rifts to regain your strength, and purify the Chaos Rifts to drive back the encroaching madness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586050/extras/5cd8a7d13d1b1cd8c2f966a69fb65b1a.avif?t=1777059546\" width=512 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A World of gods &amp; steel</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pantheon:</strong> A complete Pantheon of 12 deities, with a deep mythology that shapes the history of every faction and conflict.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultures Fallen:</strong> Explore the realm and learn of the Haldric and Valcoran cultures that shape the Realm and its politics before the Reign of Chaos, and discover the fallen cultures of ancient times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City of Mithcal:</strong> The Holy City located next to the Great Pantheon Tower, with a centuries-long history and unique culture made up of multiple origins.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CINIS</strong> is a fast-paced FPS-RPG set in a dying world. Master a lethal combination of long-range gunplay, close quarters parry-based melee, and powerful Runic Miracles in order to purge the Chaos Rifts and restore order to the Realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586050/extras/7997dcdc833f771946d562a1cbae37a5.avif?t=1777059546\" alt=\"The Reign of Chaos\" width=512 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaos Reigns</strong> under the rule of <strong>CINIS</strong>, the god of Chaos. Madness has flooded the world, and it appears it may be the very end of the Realm. Factions of the gods have turned on each other, plague runs rampant, the dead live yet again, war scorches the earth, and fields stand empty or dying.<br><br>In the midst of this, will you remain faithful to <strong>Orden</strong>, the god of Law and Order, or embrace the Chaos you swore to contain?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586050/extras/c85647630587ab1cab0aae5edcad46ca.avif?t=1777059546\" width=512 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CINIS features a unique blend of FPS Shooting, melee combat &amp; RPG mechanics</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrust and Fire:</strong> Dual-Wield a Gun and melee weapon to fire and parry in the same breath, while managing your stamina and bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your Specialty:</strong> Dodge and weave between attacks, tank them with heavy plate-armor, sneak through areas unseen, or mix-up the approach as you like. The choice is yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wield your Faith</strong>: Call upon the gods to pacify your enemies' minds, burn them with divine fire, or summon thunderstorms amidst combat through <strong>Divine Runic Miracles.</strong> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Explore The Realm &amp; Cleanse it of Chaos</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interconnected World:</strong> A fully interconnected world with no loading screens, featuring loop-backs and shortcuts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consumed by Chaos:</strong> Set foot in the chaos corrupted areas, where commoners have become violently mad, and pets have turned into blood-lusting beasts, and <strong>reality itself begins to warp</strong>. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Divine Rifts:</strong> Rest at Cleansed Rifts to regain your strength, and purify the Chaos Rifts to drive back the encroaching madness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586050/extras/5cd8a7d13d1b1cd8c2f966a69fb65b1a.avif?t=1777059546\" width=512 height=92 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>A World of gods &amp; steel</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Pantheon:</strong> A complete Pantheon of 12 deities, with a deep mythology that shapes the history of every faction and conflict.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultures Fallen:</strong> Explore the realm and learn of the Haldric and Valcoran cultures that shape the Realm and its politics before the Reign of Chaos, and discover the fallen cultures of ancient times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>City of Mithcal:</strong> The Holy City located next 